Recast a `i8` to a `i8`, clamping values to `i8::MIN..=i8::MAX` when necessary to prevent wrapping/overflow
issues.

## Examples

```
use dactyl::traits::SaturatingFrom;

assert_eq!(
    i8::saturating_from(i8::MIN),
    -128,
);
assert_eq!(
    i8::saturating_from(i8::MAX),
    127,
);
```

